rship to reach a wider audience and promote their brand.\n\nWait, let me double-check. The context mentions promoting goods or services through certain mediums. In option D, Li Ning is using the sponsorship to promote their clothing brand, which aligns with the definition. The other options don't fit as well. A is bribery, B is political, C is a policy, so D must be the correct answer.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is D) Li ning brand clothing sponsored the french sports delegation to go to the olympic games, and obtained good social and economic benefits.\n\n**Answer: D**",
