han 158,000 years, refuting the scientist's point.\n   - **Option D:** Focuses on sequence differences, not decay time, thus irrelevant to the scientist's argument.\n\n3. **Conclusion:** Option C provides evidence that DNA might last longer, directly refuting the scientist's claim.\n\n**Answer:** C",
