, putting it together, the best explanation is that even after being banned, pesticides can remain in the environment for a long time. So option B seems correct.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is B) Levels of pesticides in the environment often continue to be high for decades after their use ends.\n\n**Answer: B**",
