es that distinguish the drawing styles of different artists.\"\n\nThe context does mention that analyzing contours and hatching can help distinguish artists, but it doesn't specify if these are the main features. It might be that other factors are also important. So D might not necessarily be true.\n\nPutting it all together, the correct answer should be B because the context explicitly states that there's an analyzable difference between Clovio and Michelangelo's styles.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is B.\n\n**Answer: B**",
