t doesn't discuss whether meteorite crashes are natural or not. It's more about the impact causing extinction. So D doesn't seem to be the point.\n\nPutting it together, the paragraph's main point is that the discovery of the crater led to the consensus that meteorites caused the extinction. So the correct answer should be B.\n</think>\n\nThe correct answer is B) The discovery of the crater made scientists more consistent with the cause of dinosaur extinction.\n\n**Answer: B**",
